  "ch.trendNote": ["Tin trong Đẩy trend tự xóa sau 38 giờ. Link đã có sẽ không được gửi lại.", "Messages in Boost trend are deleted after 38 hours. Links already posted cannot be posted again.", "ข้อความในดันเทรนด์จะถูกลบหลัง 38 ชั่วโมง ลิงก์ที่มีอยู่แล้วจะส่งซ้ำไม่ได้", "推热门中的消息 38 小时后自动删除。已发布过的链接不能重复发送。", "Los mensajes de Impulsar tendencia se eliminan a las 38 horas. Los enlaces ya publicados no se pueden volver a enviar.", "As mensagens em Impulsionar trend são apagadas após 38 horas. Links já publicados não podem ser enviados de novo."],
