  "mt.lowNote": ["Bạn chưa đủ xu tím để cược. Xu tím kiếm được khi nhắn tin, nhận thưởng hằng ngày và tương tác trong app.", "You do not have enough purple coins to bet. Earn them by chatting, claiming daily rewards and engaging in the app.", "คุณมีเหรียญม่วงไม่พอสำหรับเดิมพัน รับเหรียญได้จากการแชท รางวัลรายวัน และการโต้ตอบในแอป", "你的紫币不足以押注。聊天、领取每日奖励和在应用中互动都能获得紫币。", "No tienes suficientes monedas moradas para apostar. Gánalas chateando, con las recompensas diarias e interactuando en la app.", "Você não tem moedas roxas suficientes para apostar. Ganhe conversando, com recompensas diárias e interagindo no app."],
